{"about_the_game":"FREEDIVER: Triton Down is a fully interactive single-player adventure experience in VR. Ren Tanaka is a freediver, capable of swimming to incredible depths without the use of scuba gear. A close call on her last dive has kept her landlocked for months, but when her mentor Dr. Lindstrom, an eccentric and brilliant scientist, claims to have made a stunning discovery in an underwater cavern, Ren decides to return to the deep.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/1a2e00aa69a1b3e541880e31d42813fd.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Survive a harrowing nautical disaster as Ren Tanaka, a world-class freediver.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/39e9a267809fc30a8b059f6c31f35c15.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Oxygen is your only resource, the rising seawater your greatest adversary.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/c97d4d5cdc039b544112009ab412ed9b.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Navigate virtual spaces with intuitive dive and swim movement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/4002270fc00957497e4cdbffe393b692.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Stay calm, think fast, and use your environment to escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/6abf27d7c31be9c5909724131120eaab.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Handcrafted music and SFX from an award-winning audio team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995230/extras/c988ddc4406ed7756a94b3ab004f3aa3.avif?t=1667230930\" width=596 height=118 /></span><br><br>Dive into vivid underwater environments, brought to life in UE4.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"029ff802dbed184515620b97feae8396abb49d73.jpg","localized_name":"Survivor","name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/029ff802dbed184515620b97feae8396abb49d73.jpg"},{"icon":"81d73d971003e8bde7d3bc47e5530a00d44e4770.jpg","localized_name":"Voyage of the Beagle","name":"Voyage of the Beagle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/81d73d971003e8bde7d3bc47e5530a00d44e4770.jpg"},{"icon":"e95c7e67d4587bfc6e9315b26d7a921df61f28f3.jpg","localized_name":"Not Today","name":"Not Today","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/e95c7e67d4587bfc6e9315b26d7a921df61f28f3.jpg"},{"icon":"5711a9427244f6fbde13b1c3c7f6fdfff24cd3d8.jpg","localized_name":"Positive ID","name":"Positive ID","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/5711a9427244f6fbde13b1c3c7f6fdfff24cd3d8.jpg"},{"icon":"74720227867e71ab0a0240945e4648d4ce6d196f.jpg","localized_name":"Nocturnal Vision","name":"Nocturnal Vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/74720227867e71ab0a0240945e4648d4ce6d196f.jpg"},{"icon":"eebc5e79a28d55fc93350639dbbb0c265dfbc907.jpg","localized_name":"Expert Freediver","name":"Expert Freediver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/eebc5e79a28d55fc93350639dbbb0c265dfbc907.jpg"},{"icon":"3a9f1134373fd04782181db2d03fca57f83dd0ac.jpg","localized_name":"I Thought This Was a Water Game","name":"I Thought This Was a Water Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/995230/3a9f1134373fd04782181db2d03fca5